WEBVTT

00:10:28.207 --> 00:10:30.376
in subsidizing fossil fuels.

00:10:31.335 --> 00:10:35.547
In a year 1.8 trillion
dollars into subsidies

00:10:35.589 --> 00:10:37.675
that are environmentally harmful.

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:41.261
So we go to Glasgow
and we set goals for the future,

00:10:41.303 --> 00:10:43.972
and then we go home
and we invest in the past.

00:10:44.932 --> 00:10:48.060
This is insanity, if I've ever seen it.

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:49.228
So --

00:10:49.603 --> 00:10:52.773
(Applause)

00:10:52.773 --> 00:10:54.692
So brave leadership matters,

00:10:54.692 --> 00:10:57.152
and that's what the B Team leaders
are trying to do,

00:10:57.194 --> 00:10:59.154
and we need a lot more people to join us.

00:10:59.196 --> 00:11:02.116
But brave leadership in a broken
system isn’t going to work,